# Worker secrets are never stored here: they go to `wrangler secret put` in production and to
# `apps/api/.dev.vars` (ignored by git) for local development.

# apps/api: key for every HMAC the Worker computes (login and recovery key digests, session
# token digests, fake salts and rate limit keys). At least 32 characters of random data, for
# example `openssl rand -base64 48`. Changing it invalidates every account and session.
PEPPER=
